   </title>
   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">-	Number of new and improved finance mechanisms in place and/or operational with increased finance aligned towards biodiversity 
-	Number of policy proposals influenced by new data on biodiversity finance, economic valuation and natural capital accounting
-	Amount of funds catalyzed through the implementation of finance mechanisms (mobilized, realigned, delivered more effectively, and/or through cost avoidance);  

-	Number of government officials and experts with enhanced skills to design, implement and advocate for biodiversity finance solutions (disaggregated by gender)
-	Number of Finance Solutions 
-	Number of completed Country Assessments (Policy and Institutional Reviews, Biodiversity Expenditure Reviews, Financial Needs Assessments)
-	Number of Biodiversity Finance Plans designed and endorsed at country level</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2018">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">BIOFIN Phase II will continue to build on the results achieved in Phase I: 
-	The BIOFIN Methodology is tested and available with guidance, case studies and lessons learned in BIOFIN Phase I; 
-	BIOFIN assessments are in place in 30 countries providing information, analysis and recommendations on the existing policies and institutions, biodiversity expenditure and financial gap data along with the prioritized financial needs at country level; 
-	Biodiversity Finance Plans are in place in 30 countries providing a basis for the prioritization and implementation of finance solutions at country level; 
-	Global and Country teams are in place along with Steering Committees and Technical working groups at country level.</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">- continued development of remaining finance solution proposals</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">-	120 finance Solutions identified and developed in 27 countries and under implementation
-	4000 trained individuals on the BIOFIN methodology through the E-learning module on biodiversity finance</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">- Updated country implementation strategies reflecting additional support through BIOFIN Phase II extended
- 150 finance solutions identified and under implementation
- 5 Biodiversity Finance Plans drafted
- Updated BIOFIN website</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">-	4600 trained individuals on the BIOFIN methodology through the E-learning module on biodiversity finance
- New website launched at www.biofin.org</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
